---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const seo = {
  title: "CAGR Calculator Online | Compound Annual Growth Rate India | Arthavi",
  description: "Calculate Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) online. Compare absolute returns vs CAGR for your mutual funds and stocks easily.",
};
---
<Layout
  title={seo.title}
  description={seo.description}
  keywords="cagr calculator, compound annual growth rate calculator, cagr vs xirr, calculate cagr online, absolute return vs cagr, cagr formula"
  schema={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "HowTo",
    "name": "How to Calculate CAGR",
    "description": "Learn how to calculate Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) for your investments.",
    "step": [{
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Enter initial investment",
      "text": "Input the amount you initially invested."
    }, {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Enter current value",
      "text": "Input the current value of your investment."
    }, {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Enter holding period",
      "text": "Input the number of years you have held the investment."
    }, {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Calculate CAGR",
      "text": "The formula is CAGR = [(Ending Value / Beginning Value) ^ (1 / Years)] - 1"
    }]
  })}
  breadcrumb={{
    items: [
      { name: "Home", url: "https://arthavi.com/" },
      { name: "Calculators", url: "https://arthavi.com/cagr-calculator" }
    ]
  }}
>

    

    <main class="container">
        <div class="page-header fade-in" style="text-align: center; padding: 4rem 0 2rem;margin-top: 31px;">
            <h1>CAGR Calculator</h1>
            <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
                Calculate the Compound Annual Growth Rate (CAGR) of your investments to understand your true annualized returns.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="calculator-container fade-in delay-100">
            <div class="calc-grid">
                <div class="inputs-section">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Initial Investment Value (₹)</label>
                        <div class="range-container">
                            <input type="range" id="initial" min="10000" max="10000000" step="10000" value="100000"
                                oninput="updateCAGR()">
                            <div class="input-value-box" id="initial-val">1,00,000</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Final Investment Value (₹)</label>
                        <div class="range-container">
                            <input type="range" id="final" min="10000" max="50000000" step="10000" value="250000"
                                oninput="updateCAGR()">
                            <div class="input-value-box" id="final-val">2,50,000</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Duration of Investment (Years)</label>
                        <div class="range-container">
                            <input type="range" id="years" min="1" max="40" step="1" value="5" oninput="updateCAGR()">
                            <div class="input-value-box" id="years-val">5</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="result-section">
                    <div class="result-card">
                        <div class="result-item">
                            <div class="result-label">Absolute Return</div>
                            <div class="result-value"><span id="abs-return">150</span>%</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="result-item">
                            <div class="result-label">CAGR (Annualized Return)</div>
                            <div class="result-value highlight"><span id="cagr-val">20.11</span>%</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <article class="prose fade-in delay-200" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 4rem;">
            <h2>What is a CAGR Calculator?</h2>
            <p>A <strong>CAGR calculator</strong> is a financial tool that calculates the Compound Annual Growth Rate. Unlike absolute returns which only show you the total percentage gained, CAGR smooths out the volatility and shows you exactly what your investment grew by, on average, every single year.</p>

            <h2>How to Calculate CAGR</h2>
            <p>The formula for CAGR is:</p>
            <div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; margin: 1rem 0;">
                <code>CAGR = [(Ending Value / Beginning Value) ^ (1 / Number of Years)] - 1</code>
            </div>
            <p>Doing this manually can be tedious, which is why an online CAGR calculator is necessary for quick projections.</p>

            <h3>CAGR vs XIRR</h3>
            <p>Many investors confuse CAGR with XIRR. You should only use a <strong>CAGR calculator</strong> if you made a one-time lump-sum investment (like putting ₹1,00,000 into a fixed deposit or buying a plot of land). If you are doing a monthly Mutual Fund SIP, you must use an <a href="/xirr-calculator-mutual-funds">XIRR Calculator</a> because the timing of your varied cash flows completely changes the math.</p>

            <div style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                <p class="text-muted">Track all your returns automatically</p>
                <a href="https://app.arthavi.com" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Start Tracking Portfolio</a>
            </div>
        </article>
    </main>

    

    <script>
        function updateCAGR() {
            const P = parseFloat(document.getElementById('initial').value);
            const F = parseFloat(document.getElementById('final').value);
            const n = parseFloat(document.getElementById('years').value);

            // Update display values
            document.getElementById('initial-val').innerText = P.toLocaleString('en-IN');
            document.getElementById('final-val').innerText = F.toLocaleString('en-IN');
            document.getElementById('years-val').innerText = n;

            // Absolute Return
            const absReturn = ((F - P) / P) * 100;
            
            // CAGR Calculation
            let cagr = 0;
            if (P > 0 && n > 0) {
                cagr = (Math.pow(F / P, 1 / n) - 1) * 100;
            }

            document.getElementById('abs-return').innerText = absReturn.toFixed(2);
            document.getElementById('cagr-val').innerText = cagr.toFixed(2);
        }

        // Initialize on load
        window.onload = updateCAGR;
    </script>
    

</Layout>
